    "- **Order momentum:** bookings of ^^$3.2bn in Q2^^ (+25% YoY) and a backlog that already covers 82% of guided revenue.",
    "- **Mix shift:** services grow to 38% of revenue by FY27E, lifting gross margin by ~150 bps.",
    "- **Capital returns:** $3.4bn returned in FY26 with $9.7bn of authorisation still available.",
    "**Key Risks to Monitor**",
    "- !!Customer concentration:!! top-3 customers represent 41% of revenue; a capex pause hits orders first.",
    "- !!Valuation:!! at 32x forward P/E any miss compresses the multiple before earnings catch up.",
], size=14, align="justify")

